  - "reproducibility"

abstract: >-
  A regulation-anchored reproducible benchmark comparing static and runtime
  detection of seeded cloud misconfigurations in Terraform-based Azure fintech
  payment workloads. Seven detection tools are evaluated across fifteen
  deployment variants and ten seeded misconfigurations using true-positive
  rate, false-positive rate, time-to-first-detection, statistical comparison,
  and complementarity analysis.

